  "contract": "Callboard Cache progress as on Ascension live. The client asks a quest's points with CMSG 0x731 (quest id) and reads SMSG 0x732 (quest id, points, 0); captured live replies (questcacheaddon.wdb, 2026-08/09) give Dungeon Diving 81244 15 and the world boss quest 170015 50, and uncaptured quests follow the Bronzebeard video of 2025-11-05: profession 15, world kill 20, elite 25. A quest outside the Callboard is worth 0. At login the server sends SMSG 0x730 with one cache record (count 1; id, 0, condition 0, item level 0, cache item, points per cache) and the TOKEN_TYPE_CALLBOARD_CACHE_POINTS token (SMSG 0x670: name, amount, 0). At the default release stage 7 the cache is Callboard Cache (Naxxramas) 1615009 at 15 points, the highest live threshold (Blackwing Lair, 2026-09). A turn-in adds its points and pays one cache per 15, keeping the remainder, as a live turn-in subtracted the threshold once per cache: an elite quest (25) pays one and leaves 10, a world kill (20) then reaches 30 and pays two, leaving 0, another elite pays one and leaves 10. The points survive the next login.",
